# LedgerAI screen design

Read `design-system/ledgerai/pages/app.md` before drawing a screen. It overrides the rejected glass kit in `design-system/ledgerai/MASTER.md`.

Also follow:

- `.agents/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md`
- `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md` and `references/pro-rules.md` (48dp targets, 4.5:1 text, visible press, no emoji icons, safe areas)
- UX scan: the primary answer is first, one large amount, one filled action (the mic)

Do not add a `web/` prototype. Do not introduce glassmorphism, Inter, Quicksand, Caveat, or an 8px spacing scale. Spacing stays 6, 11, 18, 29, 47. Rows are hairlines, not cards.
